# Response headers on Cloudflare (Workers static assets or Pages) — `yarn build` copies this file into dist/.
# Parcel names every script and stylesheet after its content hash, so a change is a new URL: they are cached for a
# year instead of re-checked by every screen frame on every visit (a canvas of 14 screens made ~180 requests per
# load, nearly all of them the same dozen files). Pages (.html) keep the default: re-checked every time, so a deploy
# shows at once.
/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
